  "body": "Follow-up to #287 (first slice: PR #382).\n\n**Wanted:** the Machines pane gets a \"Use for this setup\" button that sets the active setup's machine to the selected machine.\n- It goes through an undoable command (AGENTS.md \"Everything Is a Command\"). The existing `LoadMachine` command is the natural carrier.\n- A machine with validation refusals cannot be assigned, and the button names why.\n- Decide whether the Setup pane's existing machine editor window (`machine_editor.rs`) folds into the Machines pane (#148).\n\n**Done means:** an app test that the assignment does, undoes and redoes, and a UI test that the button assigns the selected machine and that a refused machine can't be assigned.\n",
